# Vault

Follow `AGENTS.md` at the vault root.

Before changing the vault, read `10 Projects/Personal System/00 Start Here.md`. Log finished work and decisions (with `why:`) in `10 Projects/Personal System/10 Log/Progress.md`, in its existing format.

Markdown in this vault is the record. Do not invent a second database, learning subjects, or an automation layer. Apps are planned in `07 Tool Ideas`; don't start one it hasn't decided on.
